            "block_content": "<table><tr><td>Element name</td><td>Type</td><td>Semantics</td></tr><tr><td>Duration</td><td>simpleType:xs:unsignedInt</td><td>The amount of seconds that define the duration of the given PriceLevelScheduleEntry.</td></tr><tr><td>PriceLevel</td><td>simpleType:xs:unsignedByte</td><td>Defines the price level of this PriceLevelScheduleEntry (referring to NumberOfPriceLevels). Small values for the PriceLevel represent a cheaper PriceLevelScheduleEntry. Large values for the PriceLevel represent a more expensive PriceLevelScheduleEntry.</td></tr></table>",
