        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 2 During the actual charging loop the present power level which is relevant for the PriceLevel can be observed by the EVCC in different ways. For AC charging it is provided by the SECC via the element EVSEPresentActivePower. For DC charging it is computed based on the EVSEPresentVoltage and EVSEPresentCurrent elements.",
